OL,3,GNEWSAThree-year protection order now in
OL,4,Aforce in town
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Public Spaces Protection Order (PSPO)
OL,7,Fis in force in a town to tackle crime
OL,8,Fand anti-social behaviour, including
OL,9,Fpublic urination and vandalism.
OL,11,FPolice said the PSPO, which gives
OL,12,Fofficers additional enforcement powers
OL,13,Fwithin a specified area, covers
OL,14,FHuntingdon town centre. It will be in
OL,15,Fplace for three years, subject to
OL,16,Fannual review.
OL,18,FIt was implemented on Thursday by
OL,19,FHuntingdon District Council, which has
OL,20,Fbeen working alongside Cambridgeshire
OL,21,FPolice, after a public consultation.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
