OL,3,GNEWSAThree-year protection order now in
OL,4,Aforce in town
OL,5,
OL,6,FNeighbourhood Insp Colin Norden said:
OL,7,F"With this order in place, we can
OL,8,Frespond more effectively to the
OL,9,Fconcerns of residents and businesses."
